card.statement:
Let $\varepsilon \in\mathbb R$ satisfy <<ref:eoj>> and let $k\in\mathbb N$. Assume that the matrix $M_k=[m_{ij}^{(k)}]$ from <<ref:rtg>> satisfies

\begin{equation}
\|M_k\|_{\cal
D}<\delta_k,\quad
\|M_k\|<\tau_k\qquad (\text{see
<<ref:21z>>}).
\end{equation}

Then

\begin{equation}
\|M_{k+1}\|_{\cal D}
<\delta_{k+1} ,\quad
\|M_{k+1}\|<\tau_{k+1}
\end{equation}

and

\begin{equation}
\|C_k\|<\varepsilon^{-1}\delta_k\qquad (\text{see
<<ref:drj1>>}).
\end{equation}
